### Create Order
POST http://localhost:8105/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-100",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

### Create Order with Out of Stock
POST http://localhost:8105/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "OUT_OF_STOCK_ITEM",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 500.00
    }
  ]
}

### Get Order Not Found
GET http://localhost:8105/api/orders/999

### Validation Error
POST http://localhost:8105/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "items": []
}

### Cancel Order
POST http://localhost:8105/api/orders/1/cancel

### Pay Order Declined
POST http://localhost:8105/api/orders/1/pay?reasonCode=DECLINED_BY_BANK
